{"step_index":288,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-16T01:08:12Z","thinking":"The initial request aimed to remove singing, but now the prompt explicitly asks for \"the singing.\" This signals a complete reversal of the previous task. The objective shifts from isolating non-singing portions to extracting the singing segments from the original recording.\n\n\nThe phrasing \"take out\" requires re-evaluation; it could mean extracting the singing or removing it. Considering the initial request and the subsequent demand for \"the singing,\" the intention appears to be to isolate singing segments. The prior instruction to \"keep talking\" in between singing portions further supports this. The user likely wants either only the singing, or the full worship service including all songs and talking, not just the talking portions.\n\n\nThe user's intent appears to be twofold: extract either the complete worship set (songs and interstitial talking) or just the individual singing segments. The initial time ranges for both scenarios are identified and the songs are broken down. Two timelines will be created using these timestamps.\n\n\nRather than choosing between timelines, both will be generated. One will contain only singing segments; the second will be the complete worship service with interstitial talking. The script will be updated to include the full worship session and its segments, plus a timeline of only the songs, complete with start and end times.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Create script to generate Singing Only timeline and Full Worship timeline in DaVinci Resolve","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"-- DaVinci Resolve Script: Create_Singing_Timeline.lua\n-- This script creates:\n-- 1. \"RLCF Sunday - Singing Only\" (The 6 songs back-to-back)\n-- 2. \"RLCF Sunday - Full Worship with Talking\" (Songs + the speaking between them, cutting out the sermon)\n\nlocal projectManager = resolve:GetProjectManager()\nlocal project = projectManager:GetCurrentProject()\nif not project then\n    print(\"No project open!\")\n    return\nend\n\nlocal mediaPool = project:GetMediaPool()\nlocal rootFolder = mediaPool:GetRootFolder()\nlocal clips = rootFolder:GetClipList()\n\n-- Find the video clip in the Media Pool\nlocal targetClip = nil\nfor i, clip in ipairs(clips) do\n    local name = clip:GetName()\n    if string.find(name, \"RLCF\") or string.find(name, \"September 13\") or string.find(name, \".mp4\") then\n        targetClip = clip\n        print(\"Found matching clip: \" .. name)\n        break\n    end\nend\n\nif not targetClip and #clips > 0 then\n    targetClip = clips[1]\nend\n\nif not targetClip then\n    print(\"Error: No clip found in Media Pool.\")\n    return\nend\n\nlocal clipFps = 30.0\nlocal fpsProp = targetClip:GetClipProperty(\"FPS\")\nif fpsProp and tonumber(fpsProp) then\n    clipFps = tonumber(fpsProp)\nend\n\nlocal startTC = targetClip:GetClipProperty(\"Start TC\")\nlocal baseFrame = 0\nif startTC and startTC ~= \"\" then\n    local h, m, s, f = string.match(startTC, \"(%d+):(%d+):(%d+):(%d+)\")\n    if h and m and s and f then\n        baseFrame = tonumber(h) * 3600 * clipFps + tonumber(m) * 60 * clipFps + tonumber(s) * clipFps + tonumber(f)\n    end\nend\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n-- 1. SINGING ONLY TIMELINE (Just the 6 songs back-to-back)\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\nlocal songs_sec = {\n    { start_s = 378.0,  end_s = 527.0,  desc = \"Song 1: Come Be Enthroned On Our Praise\" },  -- 00:06:18 - 00:08:47\n    { start_s = 563.0,  end_s = 760.0,  desc = \"Song 2: See What A Morning (Christ Is Risen)\" }, -- 00:09:23 - 00:12:40\n    { start_s = 1431.0, end_s = 1665.0, desc = \"Song 3: Jesus I Sing / Hymn\" },                -- 00:23:51 - 00:27:45\n    { start_s = 1688.0, end_s = 1799.0, desc = \"Song 4: All To His Time\" },                   -- 00:28:08 - 00:29:59\n    { start_s = 1810.0, end_s = 1940.0, desc = \"Song 5: O To Tongues of Fire\" },              -- 00:30:10 - 00:32:20\n    { start_s = 2002.0, end_s = 2172.0, desc = \"Song 6: Worship Closing Song\" }               -- 00:33:22 - 00:36:12\n}\n\nlocal songClipInfos = {}\nfor i, s in ipairs(songs_sec) do\n    local s_frame = math.floor(baseFrame + s.start_s * clipFps + 0.5)\n    local e_frame = math.floor(baseFrame + s.end_s * clipFps + 0.5)\n    table.insert(songClipInfos, {\n        mediaPoolItem = targetClip,\n        startFrame = s_frame,\n        endFrame = e_frame\n    })\nend\n\nlocal songTimeline = mediaPool:CreateEmptyTimeline(\"RLCF Sunday - Singing Only\")\nif songTimeline then\n    project:SetCurrentTimeline(songTimeline)\n    mediaPool:AppendToTimeline(songClipInfos)\n    print(\"SUCCESS: Created 'RLCF Sunday - Singing Only' timeline!\")\nend\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\n-- 2. FULL WORSHIP WITH TALKING (Songs + the talking in between, cutting the sermon)\n---------------------------------------------------------------------\nlocal worship_sec = {\n    -- From start of opening prayer (00:04:40) to end of worship (00:36:12)\n    { start_s = 280.0, end_s = 2172.0, desc = \"Complete Worship Session (Songs + In-Between Talking)\" }\n}\n\nlocal worshipClipInfos = {}\nfor i, s in ipairs(worship_sec) do\n    local s_frame = math.floor(baseFrame + s.start_s * clipFps + 0.5)\n    local e_frame = math.floor(baseFrame + s.end_s * clipFps + 0.5)\n    table.insert(worshipClipInfos, {\n        mediaPoolItem = targetClip,\n        startFrame = s_frame,\n        endFrame = e_frame\n    })\nend\n\nlocal worshipTimeline = mediaPool:CreateEmptyTimeline(\"RLCF Sunday - Worship and Talking\")\nif worshipTimeline then\n    project:SetCurrentTimeline(worshipTimeline)\n    mediaPool:AppendToTimeline(worshipClipInfos)\n    print(\"SUCCESS: Created 'RLCF Sunday - Worship and Talking' timeline!\")\nend\n","Description":"Create Lua script to extract singing timelines","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\djtwo\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\56930dde-d49e-4d64-b3a0-ddf3ad4cb3e8\\scratch\\Create_Singing_Timeline.lua","toolAction":"Save Create_Singing_Timeline.lua","toolSummary":"Save singing script"}}]}
