{"step_index":292,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-16T01:08:28Z","content":"Ah! You meant **extract/isolate the singing portion** (cutting out the sermon and the rest of the meeting)! That makes complete sense.\n\nI just created and installed the script: **`Create_Singing_Timeline`** directly into DaVinci Resolve.\n\n---\n\n### How to generate it in 1 click:\n\nIn DaVinci Resolve's top menu, click:  \n**Workspace** $\\rightarrow$ **Scripts** $\\rightarrow$ **Edit** $\\rightarrow$ **`Create_Singing_Timeline`**  \n*(or `Workspace` $\\rightarrow$ `Scripts` $\\rightarrow$ `Utility` $\\rightarrow$ `Create_Singing_Timeline`)*\n\n---\n\n### What it creates for you:\n\nIt automatically creates **two timelines** in your Media Pool:\n\n1. **`RLCF Sunday - Worship and Talking`**\n   - Contains the **complete Praise & Worship service** (`00:04:40` to `00:36:12`).\n   - Keeps all the songs **plus the prayers and speaking in between them**.\n   - Cuts out the pre-stream holding screen and cuts out the entire 1-hour+ sermon at the end.\n\n2. **`RLCF Sunday - Singing Only`**\n   - Contains **only the 6 worship songs back-to-back** (~21 minutes total), cutting out all spoken prayers/sharings.\n\nRun the script from the **Workspace** menu and both timelines will immediately appear in your Media Pool, ready to edit!"}
