{"step_index":311,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-16T01:24:09Z","thinking":"Timeline manipulation tools offer clip coloring and marker insertion. A range of clip colors are available. Segmenting the audio into clips allows each section to be identified and color-coded on the timeline.\n\n\n**Teal** is assigned to all song clips and **orange** to speaking clips for visual clarity on the timeline. Markers will be added at the start of each song clip, labeled with the song title. The timeline will be called \"RLCF Sunday - Sectioned By Song\". A list of segments is created with start/end times and type (song or speaking).\n**Song 1**: `00:06:18` to `00:08:47` (378s to 527s) -> Type: Song\n**Speaking 1**: `00:08:47` to `00:09:23` (527s to 563s) -> Type: Speaking\n**Song 2**: `00:09:23` to `00:12:40` (563s to 760s) -> Type: Song\n**Speaking 2**: `00:12:40` to `00:23:51` (760s to 1431s) -> Type: Speaking\n**Song 3**: `00:23:51` to `00:27:45` (1431s to 1665s) -> Type: Song\n**Speaking 3**: `00:27:45` to `00:28:08` (1665s to 1688s) -> Type: Speaking\n**Song 4**: `00:28:08` to `00:29:59` (1688s to 1799s) -> Type: Song\n**Speaking 4**: `00:29:59` to `00:30:10` (1799s to 1810s) -> Type: Speaking\n**Song 5**: `00:30:10` to `00:32:20` (1810s to 1940s) -> Type: Song\n**Speaking 5**: `00:32:20` to `00:33:22` (1940s to 2002s) -> Type: Speaking\n**Song 6**: `00:33:22` to `00:36:13` (2002s to 2173s) -> Type: Song\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Script to create a timeline sectioned by each individual song with markers and color-coded clips","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"-- DaVinci Resolve Script: Section_Each_Song_Timeline.lua\n-- Creates a timeline where each of the 6 songs and the in-between speaking\n-- are cut into individual, labeled clips with timeline markers.\n\nlocal projectManager = resolve:GetProjectManager()\nlocal project = projectManager:GetCurrentProject()\nif not project then\n    print(\"No project open!\")\n    return\nend\n\nlocal mediaPool = project:GetMediaPool()\nlocal rootFolder = mediaPool:GetRootFolder()\nlocal clips = rootFolder:GetClipList()\n\nlocal targetClip = nil\nfor i, clip in ipairs(clips) do\n    local name = clip:GetName()\n    if string.find(name, \"RLCF\") or string.find(name, \"September 13\") or string.find(name, \".mp4\") then\n        targetClip = clip\n        break\n    end\nend\n\nif not targetClip and #clips > 0 then\n    targetClip = clips[1]\nend\n\nif not targetClip then\n    print(\"Error: No clip found in Media Pool.\")\n    return\nend\n\nlocal clipFps = 30.0\nlocal fpsProp = targetClip:GetClipProperty(\"FPS\")\nif fpsProp and tonumber(fpsProp) then\n    clipFps = tonumber(fpsProp)\nend\n\nlocal startTC = targetClip:GetClipProperty(\"Start TC\")\nlocal baseFrame = 0\nif startTC and startTC ~= \"\" then\n    local h, m, s, f = string.match(startTC, \"(%d+):(%d+):(%d+):(%d+)\")\n    if h and m and s and f then\n        baseFrame = tonumber(h) * 3600 * clipFps + tonumber(m) * 60 * clipFps + tonumber(s) * clipFps + tonumber(f)\n    end\nend\n\n-- All individual sections between 00:06:18 and 00:36:13\nlocal sections = {\n    { start_s = 378.0,  end_s = 527.0,  name = \"Song 1: Come Be Enthroned On Our Praise\", is_song = true },\n    { start_s = 527.0,  end_s = 563.0,  name = \"Speaking: Power of Christ Risen\", is_song = false },\n    { start_s = 563.0,  end_s = 760.0,  name = \"Song 2: See What A Morning (Christ Is Risen)\", is_song = true },\n    { start_s = 760.0,  end_s = 1431.0, name = \"Speaking: Prayer & Intercession\", is_song = false },\n    { start_s = 1431.0, end_s = 1665.0, name = \"Song 3: Jesus I Sing / Hymn\", is_song = true },\n    { start_s = 1665.0, end_s = 1688.0, name = \"Speaking: Life of Christ\", is_song = false },\n    { start_s = 1688.0, end_s = 1799.0, name = \"Song 4: All To His Time\", is_song = true },\n    { start_s = 1799.0, end_s = 1810.0, name = \"Speaking: Christ In Saints\", is_song = false },\n    { start_s = 1810.0, end_s = 1940.0, name = \"Song 5: O To Tongues of Fire\", is_song = true },\n    { start_s = 1940.0, end_s = 2002.0, name = \"Speaking: Forgiveness & The Pit\", is_song = false },\n    { start_s = 2002.0, end_s = 2173.0, name = \"Song 6: Worship Closing Song\", is_song = true }\n}\n\nlocal clipInfos = {}\nfor i, sec in ipairs(sections) do\n    local s_frame = math.floor(baseFrame + sec.start_s * clipFps + 0.5)\n    local e_frame = math.floor(baseFrame + sec.end_s * clipFps + 0.5)\n    table.insert(clipInfos, {\n        mediaPoolItem = targetClip,\n        startFrame = s_frame,\n        endFrame = e_frame\n    })\nend\n\nlocal timelineName = \"RLCF Sunday - Sectioned By Song\"\nlocal timeline = mediaPool:CreateEmptyTimeline(timelineName)\nif not timeline then\n    timelineName = \"RLCF Sunday - Sectioned By Song \" .. os.time()\n    timeline = mediaPool:CreateEmptyTimeline(timelineName)\nend\n\nif timeline then\n    project:SetCurrentTimeline(timeline)\n    local timelineItems = mediaPool:AppendToTimeline(clipInfos)\n    print(\"SUCCESS: Appended all sectioned clips to timeline!\")\n\n    -- Add markers and color code the clips\n    local currentFrameOffset = 0\n    for i, sec in ipairs(sections) do\n        local durFrames = math.floor((sec.end_s - sec.start_s) * clipFps + 0.5)\n        \n        if sec.is_song then\n            -- Add Cyan marker at the start of each song\n            timeline:AddMarker(currentFrameOffset, \"Cyan\", sec.name, \"Song \" .. tostring(i), durFrames, \"\")\n        end\n\n        -- Color code timeline video clip\n        if timelineItems and timelineItems[i] then\n            pcall(function()\n                if sec.is_song then\n                    timelineItems[i]:SetClipColor(\"Teal\")\n                else\n                    timelineItems[i]:SetClipColor(\"Orange\")\n                end\n            end)\n        end\n\n        currentFrameOffset = currentFrameOffset + durFrames\n    end\n    print(\"SUCCESS: All markers and color tags applied!\")\nelse\n    print(\"Error: Could not create timeline.\")\nend\n","Description":"Create script to build timeline sectioned by song","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\djtwo\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\56930dde-d49e-4d64-b3a0-ddf3ad4cb3e8\\scratch\\Section_Each_Song_Timeline.lua","toolAction":"Save Section_Each_Song_Timeline.lua","toolSummary":"Save sectioning script"}}]}
