{"step_index":315,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-16T01:24:23Z","content":"I have created and installed a script that does this: **`Section_Each_Song_Timeline`**.\n\n---\n\n### What this timeline does:\n\n1. **Individual Slices**: Every single song and every speaking portion is sliced into its own separate clip on the timeline.\n2. **Color Coded**:\n   - 🎵 **Song Clips** = **Teal**\n   - 🎙️ **Speaking Clips** = **Orange**\n3. **Timeline Markers**: Placed directly above each song with the song title so you can jump to any song with one click or export them individually.\n\n| Clip # | Type | Name | Timecode Range |\n| :---: | :---: | :--- | :--- |\n| **1** | 🎵 **Song 1** | *Come Be Enthroned On Our Praise* | `00:06:18` $\\rightarrow$ `00:08:47` |\n| **2** | 🎙️ Speaking | *Power of Christ Risen* | `00:08:47` $\\rightarrow$ `00:09:23` |\n| **3** | 🎵 **Song 2** | *See What A Morning (Christ Is Risen)* | `00:09:23` $\\rightarrow$ `00:12:40` |\n| **4** | 🎙️ Speaking | *Prayer & Intercession* | `00:12:40` $\\rightarrow$ `00:23:51` |\n| **5** | 🎵 **Song 3** | *Jesus I Sing / Hymn* | `00:23:51` $\\rightarrow$ `00:27:45` |\n| **6** | 🎙️ Speaking | *Life of Christ* | `00:27:45` $\\rightarrow$ `00:28:08` |\n| **7** | 🎵 **Song 4** | *All To His Time* | `00:28:08` $\\rightarrow$ `00:29:59` |\n| **8** | 🎙️ Speaking | *Christ In Saints* | `00:29:59` $\\rightarrow$ `00:30:10` |\n| **9** | 🎵 **Song 5** | *O To Tongues of Fire* | `00:30:10` $\\rightarrow$ `00:32:20` |\n| **10** | 🎙️ Speaking | *Forgiveness & The Pit* | `00:32:20` $\\rightarrow$ `00:33:22` |\n| **11** | 🎵 **Song 6** | *Worship Closing Song* | `00:33:22` $\\rightarrow$ `00:36:13` |\n\n---\n\n### How to run it:\n\nIn DaVinci Resolve's top menu, click:  \n**Workspace** $\\rightarrow$ **Scripts** $\\rightarrow$ **Edit** $\\rightarrow$ **`Section_Each_Song_Timeline`**\n\nThe timeline **`RLCF Sunday - Sectioned By Song`** will appear immediately in your Media Pool with all 6 songs color-coded and marked!"}
