{"step_index":323,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-16T01:43:30Z","content":"These official hymn titles match the audio timestamps.\n\nHere are your ready-to-use YouTube chapter timestamps, plus the updated DaVinci Resolve timeline:\n\n---\n\n### 1. YouTube Video Description Chapters\n\nYou can copy and paste either of these formats directly into your YouTube description:\n\n#### Option A: Songs Only (Clean & Minimal)\n```text\n00:00 1. Come, Be Enthroned in Our Praise\n03:05 2. See, What a Morning\n17:33 3. Jesus, My Savior, Thy Greatness I See\n21:50 4. God In Heaven Hath a Treasure\n27:04 5. I Will Not Forget\n```\n\n#### Option B: Full Detail (Songs + Spoken Sharings)\n```text\n00:00 1. Come, Be Enthroned in Our Praise\n02:29 Sharing: Power of Christ Risen\n03:05 2. See, What a Morning\n06:22 Prayer & Intercession\n17:33 3. Jesus, My Savior, Thy Greatness I See\n21:27 Sharing: Life of Christ\n21:50 4. God In Heaven Hath a Treasure\n26:02 Sharing: Forgiveness & The Pit\n27:04 5. I Will Not Forget\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. Updated DaVinci Resolve Timeline\n\nI have updated the script in Resolve with these exact titles and markers:\n\n1. In DaVinci Resolve's top menu, click:  \n   **Workspace** $\\rightarrow$ **Scripts** $\\rightarrow$ **Edit** $\\rightarrow$ **`Section_Each_Song_Timeline`**\n2. A new timeline called **`RLCF Sunday - 5 Worship Songs`** will appear in your Media Pool with:\n   - All **5 songs color-coded Teal** with Cyan markers showing these exact song titles.\n   - All **sharings/prayers color-coded Orange**."}
