{"step_index":327,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-16T02:30:56Z","content":"Here is how to add the chapters to YouTube (whether it's an existing video or a new upload):\n\n---\n\n### If the video is ALREADY on YouTube:\n\n1. Go to [YouTube Studio](https://studio.youtube.com).\n2. Click **Content** on the left menu.\n3. Hover over your video and click the **Pencil icon** (Details).\n4. Scroll to the **Description** box.\n5. Paste the chapter list below directly into the description:\n\n```text\n00:00 1. Come, Be Enthroned in Our Praise\n02:29 Sharing: Power of Christ Risen\n03:05 2. See, What a Morning\n06:22 Prayer & Intercession\n17:33 3. Jesus, My Savior, Thy Greatness I See\n21:27 Sharing: Life of Christ\n21:50 4. God In Heaven Hath a Treasure\n26:02 Sharing: Forgiveness & The Pit\n27:04 5. I Will Not Forget\n```\n\n6. Click **Save** in the top right corner.\n\n> Within a few seconds, YouTube will automatically split the video's playback bar into labeled chapters!\n\n---\n\n### If you are exporting from DaVinci Resolve and uploading NEW:\n\n#### 1. Export from DaVinci Resolve:\n1. Click the **Deliver page** (the rocket ship 🚀 icon at the very bottom of Resolve).\n2. In the top-left corner, select the **H.264** or **YouTube** preset.\n3. Choose where to save the file on your computer and give it a name.\n4. Click **Add to Render Queue** at the bottom left.\n5. In the Render Queue box on the right, click **Render All**.\n\n#### 2. Upload to YouTube:\n1. Go to [YouTube.com](https://www.youtube.com) and click the **Create (camera +)** icon at the top right $\\rightarrow$ **Upload video**.\n2. Select your exported `.mp4` file.\n3. In the **Description** box, paste the exact chapter text above.\n4. Finish your upload settings and click **Publish**.","thinking":"Determining the user's intent: The query is ambiguous. The user might want to add chapters to a new upload, or modify an existing video. This needs clarification. Considering both upload and edit workflows.\n\n\n"}
